{"id":"1d700ea676b35b73","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-nfa-language-semantics.md","title":"Language Accepted by an NFA","display":"df-nfa-accepted-language — Language Accepted by an NFA","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-nfa-language-semantics","aliases":["73-df-nfa-language-semantics","73-df-nfa-accepted-language"],"display":"df-nfa-accepted-language — Language Accepted by an NFA","depends_on":["[[73-df-nfa-extended-transition]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-nfa-language-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-nfa-language-semantics</span><span>73-df-nfa-accepted-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nfa-accepted-language — Language Accepted by an NFA"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"91c5fa9978cd7fef\" href=\"?note=91c5fa9978cd7fef\" title=\"73-df-nfa-extended-transition\">73-df-nfa-extended-transition</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (nondeterministic finite automaton)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\">\\(\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\\)</span> (extended transition, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91c5fa9978cd7fef\" href=\"?note=91c5fa9978cd7fef\" title=\"73-df-nfa-extended-transition\">73-df-nfa-extended-transition</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q_0,w)\\cap F\\neq\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q_0,w)\\cap F\\neq\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An input is accepted exactly when at least one reachable state is final.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-nfa-extended-transition","status":"resolved","id":"91c5fa9978cd7fef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nfa-extended-transition]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nfa-extended-transition","status":"resolved","id":"91c5fa9978cd7fef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P(Q)$ (extended transition, see [[73-df-nfa-extended-transition]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P(Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q_0,w)\\cap F\\neq\\varnothing","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1016,"backlinks":[{"id":"52ddba8829989be5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\widehat{\\delta}_M$ 见 [[73-df-nfa-extended-transition]]，$L(M)$ 见 [[73-df-nfa-language-semantics]]；无下标的扩张转移只用于这个固定 $M$。"},{"id":"c045448153929107","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dca22faafaee72fb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma},\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}$ and $L(\\cdot)$ (automata and accepted languages, see [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]] and [[73-df-nfa-language-semantics]])"}],"outgoing":["91c5fa9978cd7fef"]}